/2 茶匙幹羅勒","1/2 茶匙幹牛至","1/8 茶匙紅椒碎","1/8 茶匙鹽","4 茶匙帕瑪森奶酪碎"],"instructions":["烤箱預熱至約 200 攝氏度。","將西葫蘆切面朝上放在烤盤中，淋上油。","混合檸檬皮屑、羅勒、牛至、紅椒碎和鹽。","把香草混合物撒在西葫蘆上。","烤 20 分鐘，或直到剛好變軟。","每半根西葫蘆撒 1 茶匙帕瑪森奶酪，靜置 5 分鐘後食用。"],"nutrition":["40 千卡","3 克碳水化合物","3 克總脂肪","1 克纖維","1 克蛋白質"]},"es":{"title":"Zucchini mediterráneo","category":"Acompañamiento de verduras","excerpt":"Zucchini al horno con aceite de oliva, ralladura de limón, hierbas, hojuelas de chile rojo y Parmesan.","tags":["Salud del corazón","Baja en carbohidratos","Acompañamiento"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"20 min","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"Las verduras sin almidón aportan volumen, fibra y color con menos carbohidratos.","carbAwareness":"Úselo para llenar la mitad de su plato.","ingredients":["2 zucchini, de 5 a 6 oz cada uno, cortados por la mitad a lo largo","2 cucharaditas de aceite de oliva","1/2 cucharadita de ralladura de limón","1/2 cucharadita de albahaca seca","1/2 cucharadita de orégano seco","1/8 cucharadita de hojuelas de chile rojo trituradas","1/8 cucharadita de sal","4 cucharaditas de queso Parmesan rallado"],"instructions":["Precaliente el horno a 400 F.","Coloque el zucchini con el lado cortado hacia arriba en una bandeja y rocíe con aceite.","Mezcle la ralladura de limón, la albahaca, el orégano, las hojuelas de chile rojo y la sal.","Espolvoree la mezcla de hierbas sobre el zucchini.","Hornee 20 minutos o hasta que esté apenas tierno.","Espolvoree cada mitad con 1 cucharadita de Parmesan y deje reposar 5 minutos antes de servir."],"nutrition":["40 calorías","3 g de carbohidratos","3 g de grasa total","1 g de fibra","1 g de proteína"]}}}','2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO recipes (id,slug,draft_json,published_json,published_at,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('recipe_import_turkey-herb-burger','turkey-herb-burger','{"image":"/recipe-covers/turkey-herb-burger.webp","originalCard":"/recipe-cards/turkey-herb-burger-card.webp","date":"2025-01-06","translations":{"en":{"title":"Turkey Herb Burger","category":"Protein mains","excerpt":"A lean ground turkey burger with fresh basil, mint, chives, and dried sage.","tags":["Lunch","Dinner","Protein"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"5 min","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"Lean protein can support fullness and make carbohydrate portions easier to plan.","carbAwareness":"Choose whole-grain buns or lettuce wraps depending on your glucose goals.","ingredients":["1 1/2 lb lean ground turkey","1/4 cup fresh basil, finely chopped","1/4 cup fresh mint, finely chopped","1/4 cup chives, finely chopped","1 tsp dried sage"],"instructions":["Combine turkey, basil, mint, chives, and sage in a large bowl.","Add salt and pepper to taste.","Mix gently and form into 4 patties.","Preheat grill or griddle pan to medium-high.","Grill and brown burgers for about 6 minutes on each side or until cooked through."],"nutrition":["256 calories","1g carbohydrates","1g total fat","13g fiber","34g protein"]},"zh-CN":{"title":"香草火鸡汉堡排","category":"蛋白质主菜","excerpt":"用瘦火鸡绞肉、新鲜罗勒、薄荷、细香葱和干鼠尾草制作的汉堡排。","tags":["午餐","晚餐","蛋白质"],"prepTime":"10 分钟","cookTime":"5 分钟","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"瘦蛋白有助于增加饱足感，也让碳水份量更容易规划。","carbAwareness":"可根据血糖目标选择全谷物汉堡胚或生菜卷。","ingredients":["约 680 克瘦火鸡绞肉","1/4 杯新鲜罗勒，切细","1/4 杯新鲜薄荷，切细","1/4 杯细香葱，切细","1 茶匙干鼠尾草"],"instructions":["将火鸡肉、罗勒、薄荷、细香葱和鼠尾草放入大碗混合。","按口味加入盐和胡椒。","轻轻拌匀，并整形成 4 个肉饼。","将烤架或煎烤锅预热至中高火。","每面烤约 6 分钟，直到上色并完全熟透。"],"nutrition":["256 千卡","1 克碳水化合物","1 克总脂肪","13 克纤维","34 克蛋白质"]},"zh-TW":{"title":"香草火雞漢堡排","category":"蛋白質主菜","excerpt":"用瘦火雞絞肉、新鮮羅勒、薄荷、細香蔥和幹鼠尾草製作的漢堡排。","tags":["午餐","晚餐","蛋白質"],"prepTime":"10 分鐘","cookTime":"5 分鐘","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"瘦蛋白有助於增加飽足感，也讓碳水份量更容易規劃。","carbAwareness":"可根據血糖目標選擇全穀物漢堡胚或生菜卷。","ingredients":["約 680 克瘦火雞絞肉","1/4 杯新鮮羅勒，切細","1/4 杯新鮮薄荷，切細","1/4 杯細香蔥，切細","1 茶匙幹鼠尾草"],"instructions":["將火雞肉、羅勒、薄荷、細香蔥和鼠尾草放入大碗混合。","按口味加入鹽和胡椒。","輕輕拌勻，並整形成 4 個肉餅。","將烤架或煎烤鍋預熱至中高火。","每面烤約 6 分鐘，直到上色並完全熟透。"],"nutrition":["256 千卡","1 克碳水化合物","1 克總脂肪","13 克纖維","34 克蛋白質"]},"es":{"title":"Hamburguesa de pavo con hierbas","category":"Platos principales con proteína","excerpt":"Una hamburguesa de pavo molido magro con albahaca fresca, menta, cebollino y salvia seca.","tags":["Almuerzo","Cena","Proteína"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"5 min","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"La proteína magra puede favorecer la saciedad y hacer más fácil planificar las porciones de carbohidratos.","carbAwareness":"Elija panes integrales o envolturas de lechuga según sus metas de glucosa.","ingredients":["1 1/2 lb de pavo molido magro","1/4 taza de albahaca fresca, finamente picada","1/4 taza de menta fresca, finamente picada","1/4 taza de cebollino, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de salvia seca"],"instructions":["Combine el pavo, la albahaca, la menta, el cebollino y la salvia en un tazón grande.","Agregue sal y pimienta al gusto.","Mezcle suavemente y forme 4 hamburguesas.","Precaliente la parrilla o plancha a fuego medio-alto.","Cocine las hamburguesas en la parrilla y dórelas unos 6 minutos por lado o hasta que estén completamente cocidas."],"nutrition":["256 calorías","1 g de carbohidratos","1 g de grasa total","13 g de fibra","34 g de proteína"]}}}','{"image":"/recipe-covers/turkey-herb-burger.webp","originalCard":"/recipe-cards/turkey-herb-burger-card.webp","date":"2025-01-06","translations":{"en":{"title":"Turkey Herb Burger","category":"Protein mains","excerpt":"A lean ground turkey burger with fresh basil, mint, chives, and dried sage.","tags":["Lunch","Dinner","Protein"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"5 min","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"Lean protein can support fullness and make carbohydrate portions easier to plan.","carbAwareness":"Choose whole-grain buns or lettuce wraps depending on your glucose goals.","ingredients":["1 1/2 lb lean ground turkey","1/4 cup fresh basil, finely chopped","1/4 cup fresh mint, finely chopped","1/4 cup chives, finely chopped","1 tsp dried sage"],"instructions":["Combine turkey, basil, mint, chives, and sage in a large bowl.","Add salt and pepper to taste.","Mix gently and form into 4 patties.","Preheat grill or griddle pan to medium-high.","Grill and brown burgers for about 6 minutes on each side or until cooked through."],"nutrition":["256 calories","1g carbohydrates","1g total fat","13g fiber","34g protein"]},"zh-CN":{"title":"香草火鸡汉堡排","category":"蛋白质主菜","excerpt":"用瘦火鸡绞肉、新鲜罗勒、薄荷、细香葱和干鼠尾草制作的汉堡排。","tags":["午餐","晚餐","蛋白质"],"prepTime":"10 分钟","cookTime":"5 分钟","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"瘦蛋白有助于增加饱足感，也让碳水份量更容易规划。","carbAwareness":"可根据血糖目标选择全谷物汉堡胚或生菜卷。","ingredients":["约 680 克瘦火鸡绞肉","1/4 杯新鲜罗勒，切细","1/4 杯新鲜薄荷，切细","1/4 杯细香葱，切细","1 茶匙干鼠尾草"],"instructions":["将火鸡肉、罗勒、薄荷、细香葱和鼠尾草放入大碗混合。","按口味加入盐和胡椒。","轻轻拌匀，并整形成 4 个肉饼。","将烤架或煎烤锅预热至中高火。","每面烤约 6 分钟，直到上色并完全熟透。"],"nutrition":["256 千卡","1 克碳水化合物","1 克总脂肪","13 克纤维","34 克蛋白质"]},"zh-TW":{"title":"香草火雞漢堡排","category":"蛋白質主菜","excerpt":"用瘦火雞絞肉、新鮮羅勒、薄荷、細香蔥和幹鼠尾草製作的漢堡排。","tags":["午餐","晚餐","蛋白質"],"prepTime":"10 分鐘","cookTime":"5 分鐘","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"瘦蛋白有助於增加飽足感，也讓碳水份量更容易規劃。","carbAwareness":"可根據血糖目標選擇全穀物漢堡胚或生菜卷。","ingredients":["約 680 克瘦火雞絞肉","1/4 杯新鮮羅勒，切細","1/4 杯新鮮薄荷，切細","1/4 杯細香蔥，切細","1 茶匙幹鼠尾草"],"instructions":["將火雞肉、羅勒、薄荷、細香蔥和鼠尾草放入大碗混合。","按口味加入鹽和胡椒。","輕輕拌勻，並整形成 4 個肉餅。","將烤架或煎烤鍋預熱至中高火。","每面烤約 6 分鐘，直到上色並完全熟透。"],"nutrition":["256 千卡","1 克碳水化合物","1 克總脂肪","13 克纖維","34 克蛋白質"]},"es":{"title":"Hamburguesa de pavo con hierbas","category":"Platos principales con proteína","excerpt":"Una hamburguesa de pavo molido magro con albahaca fresca, menta, cebollino y salvia seca.","tags":["Almuerzo","Cena","Proteína"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"5 min","servings":"4","diabetesNote":"La proteína magra puede favorecer la saciedad y hacer más fácil planificar las porciones de carbohidratos.","carbAwareness":"Elija panes integrales o envolturas de lechuga según sus metas de glucosa.","ingredients":["1 1/2 lb de pavo molido magro","1/4 taza de albahaca fresca, finamente picada","1/4 taza de menta fresca, finamente picada","1/4 taza de cebollino, finamente picado","1 cucharadita de salvia seca"],"instructions":["Combine el pavo, la albahaca, la menta, el cebollino y la salvia en un tazón grande.","Agregue sal y pimienta al gusto.","Mezcle suavemente y forme 4 hamburguesas.","Precaliente la parrilla o plancha a fuego medio-alto.","Cocine las hamburguesas en la parrilla y dórelas unos 6 minutos por lado o hasta que estén completamente cocidas."],"nutrition":["256 calorías","1 g de carbohidratos","1 g de grasa total","13 g de fibra","34 g de proteína"]}}}','2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z','2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO recipes (id,slug,draft_json,published_json,published_at,created_at,updated_at) VALUES ('recipe_import_turkey-meatball-wonton-soup-bok-choy-carrots','turkey-meatball-wonton-soup-bok-choy-carrots','{"image":"/recipe-covers/turkey-meatball-wonton-soup.webp","originalCard":"/recipe-cards/turkey-meatball-wonton-soup-card.webp","date":"2025-01-30","translations":{"en":{"title":"Turkey Meatball Wonton Soup with Bok Choy & Carrots","category":"Soup","excerpt":"A diabetes-friendly Asian-fusion soup with turkey meatballs, bok choy, carrots, ginger, garlic, and cilantro.","tags":["Dinner","Soup","High Protein"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"15 min","servings":"6","diabetesNote":"Brothy meals with vegetables and protein can be filling without feeling heavy.","carbAwareness":"Breadcrumbs count as carbohydrates; portion soup intentionally.","ingredients":["8 cup low sodium chicken broth","4 tsp toasted sesame oil","1 1/2 tbsp lower sodium soy sauce","2 tsp Thai style chili garlic sauce","1 tsp fish sauce","4 cloves garlic, minced","1 tbsp fresh ginger paste","1 bunch fresh cilantro, minced","1 bunch green onion, minced","1 lb lean ground turkey","1 cup panko bread crumbs","1 tsp lower sodium soy sauce","2 eggs","1/2 tsp Chinese five-spice powder","8 baby bok choy, roots trimmed and roughly chopped","1 cup shredded carrots"],"instructions":["Heat broth, sesame oil, soy sauce, chili-garlic sauce, and fish sauce in a large pot.","Add half the garlic, ginger, cilantro, and green onions to the pot.","Transfer remaining aromatics to a bowl.","Mix turkey, breadcrumbs, soy sauce, eggs, five-spice, and aromatics by hand.","Form rounded meatballs and drop into the pot.","Simmer 5-6 minutes until meatballs are cooked through.","Add bok choy and carrots and cook 4-5 minutes more."],"nutrition":["280 calories","20g carbohydrates","11g total fat","4g fiber","26g protein"]},"zh-CN":{"title":"云吞风味火鸡肉丸汤配小白菜和胡萝卜","category":"汤品","excerpt":"适合糖尿病饮食思路的亚洲融合汤品，含火鸡肉丸、小白菜、胡萝卜、姜、蒜和香菜。","tags":["晚餐","汤品","高蛋白"],"prepTime":"10 分钟","cookTime":"15 分钟","servings":"6","diabetesNote":"清汤类餐食搭配蔬菜和蛋白质，可以有饱足感，同时不至于过于厚重。","carbAwareness":"面包糠需要计入碳水；请有计划地安排汤品份量。","ingredients":["8 杯低钠鸡汤","4 茶匙烤香芝麻油","1 1/2 汤匙低钠酱油","2 茶匙泰式蒜蓉辣椒酱","1 茶匙鱼露","4 瓣大蒜，切末","1 汤匙新鲜姜泥","1 把新鲜香菜，切末","1 把葱，切末","约 450 克瘦火鸡绞肉","1 杯日式面包糠","1 茶匙低钠酱油","2 个鸡蛋","1/2 茶匙五香粉","8 棵小白菜，去根并粗切","1 杯胡萝卜丝"],"instructions":["在大锅中加热鸡汤、芝麻油、酱油、蒜蓉辣椒酱和鱼露。","将一半大蒜、姜、香菜和葱加入锅中。","把剩余香料移入碗中。","用手混合火鸡肉、面包糠、酱油、鸡蛋、五香粉和香料。","捏成圆形肉丸，放入锅中。","小火煮 5-6 分钟，直到肉丸熟透。","加入小白菜和胡萝卜，再煮 4-5 分钟。"],"nutrition":["280 千卡","20 克碳水化合物","11 克总脂肪","4 克纤维","26 克蛋白质"]},"zh-TW":{"title":"雲吞風味火雞肉丸湯配小白菜和胡蘿蔔","category":"湯品","excerpt":"適合糖尿病飲食思路的亞洲融合湯品，含火雞肉丸、小白菜、胡蘿蔔、姜、蒜和香菜。","tags":["晚餐","湯品","高蛋白"],"prepTime":"10 分鐘","cookTime":"15 分鐘","servings":"6","diabetesNote":"清湯類餐食搭配蔬菜和蛋白質，可以有飽足感，同時不至於過於厚重。","carbAwareness":"麪包糠需要計入碳水；請有計劃地安排湯品份量。","ingredients":["8 杯低鈉雞湯","4 茶匙烤香芝麻油","1 1/2 湯匙低鈉醬油","2 茶匙泰式蒜蓉辣椒醬","1 茶匙魚露","4 瓣大蒜，切末","1 湯匙新鮮姜泥","1 把新鮮香菜，切末","1 把蔥，切末","約 450 克瘦火雞絞肉","1 杯日式麪包糠","1 茶匙低鈉醬油","2 個雞蛋","1/2 茶匙五香粉","8 棵小白菜，去根並粗切","1 杯胡蘿蔔絲"],"instructions":["在大鍋中加熱雞湯、芝麻油、醬油、蒜蓉辣椒醬和魚露。","將一半大蒜、姜、香菜和蔥加入鍋中。","把剩餘香料移入碗中。","用手混合火雞肉、麪包糠、醬油、雞蛋、五香粉和香料。","捏成圓形肉丸，放入鍋中。","小火煮 5-6 分鐘，直到肉丸熟透。","加入小白菜和胡蘿蔔，再煮 4-5 分鐘。"],"nutrition":["280 千卡","20 克碳水化合物","11 克總脂肪","4 克纖維","26 克蛋白質"]},"es":{"title":"Sopa wonton con albóndigas de pavo, bok choy y zanahorias","category":"Sopa","excerpt":"Una sopa de inspiración asiática compatible con la diabetes, con albóndigas de pavo, bok choy, zanahorias, jengibre, ajo y cilantro.","tags":["Cena","Sopa","Alta en proteína"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"15 min","servings":"6","diabetesNote":"Las comidas con caldo, verduras y proteína pueden ser saciantes sin sentirse pesadas.","carbAwareness":"El pan rallado cuenta como carbohidrato; sirva la sopa con una porción intencional.","ingredients":["8 tazas de caldo de pollo bajo en sodio","4 cucharaditas de aceite de sésamo tostado","1 1/2 cucharadas de salsa de soya baja en sodio","2 cucharaditas de salsa tailandesa de chile y ajo","1 cucharadita de salsa de pescado","4 dientes de ajo, picados","1 cucharada de pasta de jengibre fresco","1 manojo de cilantro fresco, picado","1 manojo de cebolla verde, picada","1 lb de pavo molido magro","1 taza de pan rallado panko","1 cucharadita de salsa de soya baja en sodio","2 huevos","1/2 cucharadita de polvo chino de cinco especias","8 bok choy baby, con raíces recortadas y picados en trozos grandes","1 taza de zanahorias ralladas"],"instructions":["Caliente el caldo, el aceite de sésamo, la salsa de soya, la salsa de chile y ajo, y la salsa de pescado en una olla grande.","Agregue a la olla la mitad del ajo, el jengibre, el cilantro y la cebolla verde.","Pase los aromáticos restantes a un tazón.","Mezcle a mano el pavo, el pan rallado, la salsa de soya, los huevos, las cinco especias y los aromáticos.","Forme albóndigas redondeadas y colóquelas en la olla.","Cocine a fuego lento de 5 a 6 minutos, hasta que las albóndigas estén bien cocidas.","Agregue el bok choy y las zanahorias y cocine de 4 a 5 minutos más."],"nutrition":["280 calorías","20 g de carbohidratos","11 g de grasa total","4 g de fibra","26 g de proteína"]}}}','{"image":"/recipe-covers/turkey-meatball-wonton-soup.webp","originalCard":"/recipe-cards/turkey-meatball-wonton-soup-card.webp","date":"2025-01-30","translations":{"en":{"title":"Turkey Meatball Wonton Soup with Bok Choy & Carrots","category":"Soup","excerpt":"A diabetes-friendly Asian-fusion soup with turkey meatballs, bok choy, carrots, ginger, garlic, and cilantro.","tags":["Dinner","Soup","High Protein"],"prepTime":"10 min","cookTime":"15 min","servings":"6","diabetesNote":"Brothy meals with vegetables and protein can be filling without feeling heavy.","carbAwareness":"Breadcrumbs count as carbohydrates; portion soup intentionally.","ingredients":["8 cup low sodium chicken broth","4 tsp toasted sesame oil","1 1/2 tbsp lower sodium soy sauce","2 tsp Thai style chili garlic sauce"